@startuml
title Phase 10a — Control Plane — plan

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

start

:10a.1 plan;
partition "Server" {
  :10a.2 app/ daemon serving kernel/api over loopback HTTP;
  :health/ready;
}
partition "Resources" {
  :10a.3 projects + work (memory + kernel planner/scheduler/allocator);
  :10a.4 memory + retrieval;
  :10a.5 tools (toolbox host/policy) + nodes (single-node);
}
partition "Hardening" {
  :10a.6 rpc-v1 envelope/errors; bearer carrying; fake/no-model path;
}
:10a.7 httptest integration + docs + summary;

stop

note right
  Spec: contracts/openapi/control-plane-v1.yaml.
  Loopback only; authn = phase 12.
  Core path deterministic (no model).
  Budget: ~7 commits (phase 10 total 10-15).
  Console TUI/UI design: decided separately (phase 10b).
end note

@enduml
